playitslowly 1.6.1
==================
* Label the waveform height slider

playitslowly 1.6.0
==================
First release of the maintained fork (github.com/BeatLink/playitslowly).
* Runs on current systems: GTK 3 pinned, Python 3.14, GStreamer 1.28
* Waveform display with zoom and draggable loop markers (thanks Mauro Passerino)
* Total time in the clock (thanks kenhuang-io), app id for Wayland (thanks City-busz),
  better appdata (thanks Mathieu Bridon)
* Balance, left/right and mid/side modes, a limiter and a count-in
* A loop switch, nudge buttons for the loop points and many new keyboard and
  number pad shortcuts
* Download the audio of YouTube videos with yt-dlp, drag and drop files
* Export as WAV, MP3, Ogg Vorbis or FLAC, optionally only the loop section, with progress
* Fixed looping at the end of a track, rewinding by seconds, the end position
  after loading a file, and Save As restarting playback after a gap
* Packages for Debian, Fedora, Flatpak, AppImage and Nix; install with make

